{"id":"74518fe8da772d53","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-model6-isolated-type.md","title":"ZFC Model6 Isolated Type","display":"df-zfc-model6-isolated-type — ZFC Model6 Isolated Type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model6-isolated-type","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model6-isolated-type"],"display":"df-zfc-model6-isolated-type — ZFC Model6 Isolated Type","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-type]]","[[../batch13/58-df-consistency.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-proof.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-language-with-constants.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model6-isolated-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model6-isolated-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model6-isolated-type — ZFC Model6 Isolated Type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c8dfa3853919882a\" href=\"?note=c8dfa3853919882a\" title=\"58-df-type\">58-df-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6996aaff4caeacce\" href=\"?note=6996aaff4caeacce\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-consistency.md\">../batch13/58-df-consistency.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" href=\"?note=68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-proof.md\">../batch04/58-df-proof.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"303ea9f3c70914f9\" href=\"?note=303ea9f3c70914f9\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-language-with-constants.md\">../batch10/58-df-language-with-constants.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,T,A,p,n,\\mathcal P,\\bot\\in V\">\\(L,T,A,p,n,\\mathcal P,\\bot\\in V\\)</span> (language, theory, parameters, type arity, proof system, and contradiction code)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type}_S(p,A,T,L,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Type}_S(p,A,T,L,n)\\)</span> (type predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c8dfa3853919882a\" href=\"?note=c8dfa3853919882a\" title=\"58-df-type\">58-df-type</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S\\)</span> (named-language predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"303ea9f3c70914f9\" href=\"?note=303ea9f3c70914f9\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-language-with-constants.md\">../batch10/58-df-language-with-constants.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S\\)</span> (explicit syntactic predicates from the dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6IsolatedType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel6IsolatedType}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}isolated\\text{-}type} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel6IsolatedType}_S(L,T,A,p,n,\\mathcal P,\\bot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Type}_S(p,A,T,L,n)\\land\\exists L_A,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(L_A,L,A,c)\\land p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_A)\\land\\exists\\theta\\in p\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S(T\\cup\\{\\neg\\forall v_0\\,\\neg\\theta\\},\\mathcal P,L_A,\\bot)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\\exists\\pi\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,\\forall v_0\\,(\\theta\\to\\varphi),\\mathcal P,L_A)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}isolated\\text{-}type} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel6IsolatedType}_S(L,T,A,p,n,\\mathcal P,\\bot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Type}_S(p,A,T,L,n)\\land\\exists L_A,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(L_A,L,A,c)\\land p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_A)\\land\\exists\\theta\\in p\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{ConsistentTheory}_S(T\\cup\\{\\neg\\forall v_0\\,\\neg\\theta\\},\\mathcal P,L_A,\\bot)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\\exists\\pi\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,\\forall v_0\\,(\\theta\\to\\varphi),\\mathcal P,L_A)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Isolation is relative to one explicit named language and proof context; the old clause used incompatible type and consistency arities and an unbound derivability notation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"c8dfa3853919882a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-consistency.md","status":"resolved","id":"6996aaff4caeacce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor"